<title>USA: GM December US total vehicle sales fall.</title>
<headline>GM December US total vehicle sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors Corp</p>
<p>			Dec 1-31, 1996     Dec 1-31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Total Car		190,316	   217,469	    -12.5</p>
<p> Total Truck	    155,706	   184,383	    -15.6</p>
<p> Total Vehicle	  346,022	   401,852	    -13.9</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Dec 31, 1996 Jan 1-Dec 31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Total Car	    2,786,110	 2,956,211	     -6.4</p>
<p> Total Truck	  2,007,059	 1,939,157	     +2.8</p>
<p> Total Vehicle	4,793,169	 4,895,368	     -2.7</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 25 in latest month vs 25, 308 for year to date vs 306 in year ago.</p>
</text>
